text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattleTowerSign {
    "This is the BATTLE TOWER!\n"
    "Keep the win streak as the toughest\l"
    "TRAINER!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattlePalaceSign {
    "This is the BATTLE PALACE!\n"
    "Keep your eyes on POKéMON battles!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattleArenaSign {
    "This is the BATTLE ARENA!\n"
    "Let the toughest teams gather!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattlePyramidSign {
    "This is the BATTLE PYRAMID!\n"
    "Advance through the Battle Quest!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_RankingHallSign {
    "BATTLE FRONTIER RANKING HALL\n"
    "Set your sights on new records!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ExchangeCornerSign {
    "BATTLE POINT EXCHANGE SERVICE CORNER\n"
    "Exchange your Battle Points!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BattleTowerFeelsSpecial {
    "Wow!\n"
    "It's huge!\p"
    "The BATTLE TOWER feels special.\n"
    "It's different from the others.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ConquerLeagueAndFrontier {
    "My grand ambition is to conquer both\n"
    "the BATTLE FRONTIER and the POKéMON\l"
    "LEAGUE.\p"
    "And if my dream comes true…\p"
    "I… I'm going to ask MIMI next door\n"
    "if she will be friends with me!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PyramidTooHarsh {
    "The BATTLE PYRAMID's too harsh!\n"
    "I just can't make it to the top!\p"
    "Since I'm out of options, maybe I can\n"
    "climb the outside…$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ThriveInDarkness {
    "I thrive in darkness…\n"
    "Yes… What is worthy of me?\l"
    "None other than the BATTLE PYRAMID…\p"
    "What say you to wandering in darkness\n"
    "and in utter and total desperation?$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PutTogetherUltimateTeam {
    "I didn't sleep for a week, but then\n"
    "I put together the ultimate team!\p"
    "I can't see myself losing, no joke.\n"
    "We're storming the BATTLE ARENA!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_DidScottBringYouHere {
    "Did SCOTT bring you here, too?\n"
    "What is it with that guy?\p"
    "It sounds like he really does know\n"
    "how to spot talented TRAINERS, but…\p"
    "I've never seen him battling in person\n"
    "ever.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BelieveInYouBuddy {
    "ZIGG!\n"
    "I believe in you, little buddy!\p"
    "I'll make my little ZIGG any favorite\n"
    "tasty treats you like if you win!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ZigzagoonLooksVacant {
    "ZIGZAGOON looks vacant…$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PeopleCallMeBusybody {
    "People call me a busybody,\n"
    "but I can't help it.\p"
    "Your hat's on crooked!\n"
    "Oh, no, trash on the ground!\l"
    "Oops, it's almost dinnertime!\p"
    "I don't know if I can stand to just\n"
    "watch at the BATTLE PALACE…$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_OnceBeatGymLeader {
    "I may not look that impressive now,\n"
    "but I once beat a GYM LEADER.\p"
    "Who knows, maybe I should give it\n"
    "another shot at glory.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_FastOnBikeAndBattles {
    "I'm fast on my BIKE, and that goes for\n"
    "the way I battle, too.\p"
    "I win matches in the blink of\n"
    "an eye!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_BetterThanDaddyAtPokemon {
    "I'm better than my daddy\n"
    "at POKéMON.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_GoRackUpSomeWinsForDaddy {
    "Go on, my baby sweetie!\n"
    "Go rack up some wins for Daddy!\p"
    "You're just like your mother,\n"
    "so you'll be dominating!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_HeardPrettyGirlAtBattleArena {
    "It wasn't easy getting here,\n"
    "but I'd heard about this knockout\l"
    "pretty girl at the BATTLE ARENA.\p"
    "Instead of her, do you know what\n"
    "I found?\p"
    "A whole teeming mob of sweaty,\n"
    "stinky, and primitive martial artists!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_SometimesImportantOldManInThere {
    "I sometimes see this really important-\n"
    "looking old man going in there.\p"
    "He has these really awesome POKéMON.\n"
    "He seems really nice, though.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_LegendOfBattlePyramid {
    "Do you know it?\n"
    "The legend of the BATTLE PYRAMID?\p"
    "When there comes a confident TRAINER\n"
    "reaching for the golden pinnacle,\l"
    "there shall appear a man among men.\p"
    "Don't know that legend?\n"
    "Well, of course not!\l"
    "I just made it up!\p"
    "What's it supposed to mean?\n"
    "That, my friend, I can't say!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_GotWipedOut {
    "Man! Oh man!\n"
    "I've never lost once before!\p"
    "But I got wiped out with no saving\n"
    "grace at all!\p"
    "And then I'm told I don't have any\n"
    "talent?! Man!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_ToughTrainerInBattleTower {
    "This guy ran into a horribly tough\n"
    "TRAINER while he was on the BATTLE\l"
    "TOWER challenge.\p"
    "Now look at him…\p"
    "You need to be cautious if you ever\n"
    "decide to go to the BATTLE TOWER.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_EnoughBattlePointsForDoll {
    "Yes!\n"
    "I've finally got enough Battle Points!\p"
    "I guess I'll trade for another giant\n"
    "plush DOLL!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_LikeToHaveNameRecordedHere {
    "Oh, yeah, okay!\n"
    "So this is the RANKING HALL!\p"
    "I'd like to go down in history as\n"
    "a super champ and have my name\l"
    "recorded here for posterity.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_CanDoAnythingWithYou {
    "With you by my side, I can do anything.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_PowerOfOurLoveWillOvercome {
    "Ooh, darling, you are so wonderful!\p"
    "Ooh, I just can't wait anymore!\p"
    "Let's go to a MULTI BATTLE ROOM\n"
    "right this instant!\p"
    "If we get together in the BATTLE SALON,\n"
    "the power of our love will overcome\l"
    "everyone we meet.\p"
    "Why, before us, darling, everything\n"
    "will topple like dominoes!$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_FrontierNotExclusivelyForToughTrainers {
    "The BATTLE FRONTIER isn't exclusively\n"
    "for tough TRAINERS.\p"
    "Many people with special abilities\n"
    "have been invited, it seems.\p"
    "That man SCOTT…\p"
    "He may have built this place to serve\n"
    "a bigger objective…$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_OddTreeHereSeemsToWiggle {
    "Excuse me, young one.\n"
    "Have you good eyesight?\p"
    "There is an odd tree past here, and to\n"
    "my tired eyes it seems to wiggle.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_OnceAnOddTreePastHere {
    "Excuse me, young one.\n"
    "Have you a good memory?\p"
    "I have this feeling there once was\n"
    "an odd tree past here.$"
}

text BattleFrontier_OutsideEast_Text_StickyMonWithLongTail {
    "I…\n"
    "I saw it!\p"
    "There was a sticky sort of a POKéMON\n"
    "with a long tail up ahead!\p"
    "It was hiding under a boulder, and\n"
    "it kept staring at me!$"
}
